# Line endings: this repository is LF-canonical.
#
# Byte-identity between design-spec/ and claude-plugin/openaos/ is a hard
# invariant (runbook §35, §36.2 step 4; enforced by validate-content.py VC2 and
# validate-workflow-specs.py WS1-WS2). That invariant is defined on file *bytes*,
# so line endings must not vary by platform or by contributor. Without this file,
# a Windows checkout can silently rewrite every tracked text file to CRLF, which
# buries real diffs in whole-file churn.
#
# Editors on Windows will show LF. That is intended.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets - never normalized, never diffed as text.
*.pdf   binary
*.pptx  binary
